# Normalise line endings. Without this, a Windows clone rewrites every file to
# CRLF, which shows up as a repo-wide diff the moment anyone saves a file.
# Everything here is JavaScript or TypeScript read by Node, which is happy with
# LF on every platform, so LF everywhere is the simplest correct answer.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries must never be line-ending converted.
*.docx binary
*.pdf  binary
*.zip  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.ico  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
